The reason for the low rating is purely down to how the game operates. It is riddled with bots, very easy to work them out. The shot and ball dynamics are inconsistent meaning play falls whichever way the game is programmed to. No ads is great but the game is full of in app prompts to make a purchase, normally when you've lost your last remaining coins. It is designed to try and pry as much money out of players as possible. It's a shame as this could be a great, pick up and play pool game.-[split]-Hi game. We are sorry to hear that. Try clearing your feedback and we are sorry to hear that you have any questions, please contact us via our support team at <URL> and we will check it for you. Thank you.
