Service : Absolutely the best quality audio streaming offers and I did test Spotify, Tidal and QoBuz. If you own hi quality speakers, headset or earplugs, that are compatible with 24bits/44k+ FLAC (real lossless format), this is definately worth the subscription. App : Dev team listens to customers, thank you for the track fonction ! We only miss a native UPnP output support, that would be huge 🙏🏻🥰 Thanks for caring about the suggestions !-[split]-Dear : Thank you for your kind review ! We are excited to have enthusiastic people like you in our family ! Musically yours, The Qobuz Team
