Fantastic service and fantastic steaming app. Navigation in the app is very intuitive with good use of left right up and down gestures from the now playing screen. Having the ability to easily change the streaming quality is simple and well implemented. The app intelligently downloads songs that are being played to available storage space without intervention. Being able to store manage the downloaded music queue sets it apart from the other streaming apps. The UI on the phone has everything needed quickly available at your fingertips. Well thought out and organized. Also customer support is very responsive. One thing is lacking: Android and Galaxy Watch integration. I can control playback. Buy why don't I see album art on my watch as is shown by practically every other streaming app? Finally, a streaming service for adults, nerds and audiophiles.-[split]-Dear audiophiles. Thank you very much for your kind review ! We are excited to hear that you have any questions, please feel free to reach us at <EMAIL>. We are excited to hear that you have any questions, please feel free to reach us at <EMAIL>. We are excited to hear that you have any questions, please feel free to reach us at <EMAIL>. We are excited to hear that you have any questions, please feel free to reach us at <EMAIL>. We are excited to hear that you have any questions, please feel free to reach us at <EMAIL>. We are excited to hear that you have any questions, please feel free to reach us at <EMAIL>. We are excited to hear that you have any questions, please feel free to reach us at <EMAIL>. We are excited to hear that you have any questions, please feel free to reach us at <EMAIL>. We are excited to hear that you have any questions, please feel free to reach us at <EMAIL>. We are excited to hear that you have any questions, please feel free to reach us at <EMAIL>. We are excited to hear that you have any
