It's an okay app. However, there's a fairly severe UI error in the app related to the Offline Library. If you play tracks from the Offline Library while on mobile data but you haven't disallowed streaming on mobile data, the tracks will be streamed and not played from the offline version. I consumed 500mb yesterday before realising the flaw.-[split]-Hello, we are sorry that you experienced problems with the app. We are excited to have enthusiastic people like you in our family ! Musically yours, The Qobuz Team
