I dont approve of frequent split second pauses during playback. It is very fustrating when I am enjoying the music only to have the experience ruined by these constant pauses. Split second disrputions occur on roughly 99% of these recordings. These distractions are providing more than enough reason to cancel the service and to discourage others from use. One thing to be honest about however is that during moments of uninterrupted playback, the sound quality is excellent. Just needs consistance.-[split]-Dear consistance. We are sorry to hear that you experienced with our service. Kind regards, the Qobuz team
Amazing sound quality, app functions very well, but could really use a better translation. Playlist "sort" option is really a search, and there is no sort afaik. For some reason the translators mixed up "select" with "validate" in the genre select menu, which is all a bit confusing for English speakers. Would love if Devs could add a "sort" (ie alphabetical/date added) for playlists, and add the search function for playlists to the main screen instead of in the settings drop-down.-[split]-Dear drop-down. Thank you for your kind review ! We are excited to have enthusiastic people like you in our family ! Musically yours, The Qobuz Team
The first thing I tried was to search for artist "The Husht". The Top Results tab showed poor matches at best. I switched to the Artists tab, and there it was, but it was several positions down below poor matches ("Hushti", "Hushtones", etc.) even though it was an EXACT match. Qobuz seems to be punishing lesser-known artists by not even letting fans explicitly search for them. So much for all their artist-friendly advertising, and so much for giving Qobuz a shot at replacing Spotify.-[split]-Hello, we are sorry that you experienced problems with the app. We are excited to have enthusiastic people like you in our family ! Musically yours, The Qobuz Team
